Kulthera User & Analytics Evolution Plan
The goal of this phase is to move from an anonymous, static-demo state into a functional, user-driven platform with robust backend persistence. We will reintroduce the login/signup flow, differentiate between Creators and Art Enthusiasts, build out the Creator Dashboard with conversion/translation metrics, add entry modals for cultural context, and refine the gallery/navbar.

User Review Required
IMPORTANT

Creator vs. Enthusiast Linking: When a user signs up as a "Creator", they need an associated Creator profile (with a wallet address, bio, etc.). For this MVP step, I propose that signing up as a Creator automatically generates an empty placeholder Creator profile for them which they can manage later, or links them to an existing demo creator profile. I will proceed with generating an empty placeholder profile.
Currency Conversion (Translation by location): Web Monetization streams in ILP packets (e.g., USD or standard ILP). I will implement a visual localization layer in the UI that takes the USD amount and converts it to a local equivalent (e.g., Nigerian Naira - NGN, or West African CFA franc) based on a selected or mocked local region to demonstrate the "Translation by location" requirement.
